   "subject": "10 Simple Rules for Effective Statistical Practice",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"#0563C1\" vlink=\"#954F72\">\r\n<div>\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding:3.75pt .75pt 3.75pt 7.5pt\">\r\n<h2>Statisticians Compile List of 10 Simple Rules for Effective Statistical Practice<u></u><u></u></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n<p><a href=\"http://journals.plos.org/ploscompbiol/article?id=10.1371%2Fjournal.pcbi.1004961\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://journals.plos.org/ploscompbiol/article?id%3D10.1371%252Fjournal.pcbi.1004961&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237118627000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2aEcKvJ3jFRH71JVxWLUhJ\"><span style=\"color:#1b75bb;text-decoration:none\"><img border=\"0\" width=\"115\" src=\"https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/proxy/h_OrKsqVkY8tgsY3DSkG3gE0x4YbqyWeVWJlEnoXndWf9UVQWYfFFQK6xiXBw9Tcw7QB6k74vvBfoPJv39Et0CU0_kkBjlIRNNrFM2EWuUI=s0-d-e1-ft#http://www.amstat.org/images/emails/ten_simple_rules_plos.jpg\"></span></a><br>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:7.0pt;color:#7e7e7e\">Credit: PLOS</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n<p>Statistics may be everywhere, but they aren&#39;t always understood, calculated, or communicated effectively. After a suggestion from the ASA, a group of leading statisticians penned &quot;Ten Simple Rules for Effective Statistical Practice&quot; to help researchers avoid\r\n pitfalls of misrepresenting data or formulating hypotheses based on faulty statistical reasoning.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"http://journals.plos.org/ploscompbiol/article?id=10.1371%2Fjournal.pcbi.1004961\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://journals.plos.org/ploscompbiol/article?id%3D10.1371%252Fjournal.pcbi.1004961&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237118627000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2aEcKvJ3jFRH71JVxWLUhJ\">The list was recently published in the journal\r\n<em><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1b75bb\">Computational Biology</span></em>.</a> Share it with colleagues!<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"http://journals.plos.org/ploscompbiol/article?id=10.1371%2Fjournal.pcbi.1004961#sec011\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://journals.plos.org/ploscompbiol/article?id%3D10.1371%252Fjournal.pcbi.1004961%23sec011&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237118627000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1QOxfDyrODgm1wY-el0JGP\">http://journals.plos.org/ploscompbiol/article?id=10.1371%2Fjournal.pcbi.1004961#sec011</a>\r\n<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"SL\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">--\r\n<br>\r\nAndrej Blejec<br>\r\nNational Institute of Biology<br>\r\nVecna pot 111 POB 141, SI-1000 Ljubljana, SLOVENIA<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"SL\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">e-mail:\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:blue\">andrej...@nib.si</span></a><br>\r\nURL: <a href=\"http://ablejec.nib.si/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://ablejec.nib.si/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237118627000&amp;usg=AOvVaw14Z3u7xQ4VlYJ-PO5_51X7\"><span style=\"color:blue\">http://ablejec.nib.si</span></a>\r\n<br>\r\ntel: + 386 (0)59 232 789<br>\r\nfax: <a href=\"tel:+386%201%20241%2029%2080\" value=\"+38612412980\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+ 386 1 241 29 80</a><br>\r\n--------------------------<br>\r\nOrganizer of<br>\r\nApplied Statistics 2016 conference<br>\r\n<a href=\"http://conferences.nib.si/AS2016/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://conferences.nib.si/AS2016/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237118627000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2SXh9shcjl9MhxRj6lHXDz\"><span style=\"color:blue\">http://conferences.nib.si/AS2016/</span></a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
    ]
