     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\">Zanimivo branje, hvala lepa. Spodaj pa posredujem še svež članek izpod peresa Zuurja in Ienove, ki je, kot je za njiju že v navadi, zelo praktičen. Verjamem, da bo marsikdo našel kak zanimiv košček tudi zase. Če kdo nima dostopa do PDF-ja, me lahko kontaktira &quot;off-list&quot;.</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;trebuchet ms&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\">Zuur, A. F., &amp; Ieno, E. N. (2016). A protocol for conducting and presenting results of regression-type analyses. Methods in Ecology and Evolution, 7(6), 636–645. <a href=\"http://doi.org/10.1111/2041-210X.12577\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://doi.org/10.1111/2041-210X.12577&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237118629000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2e02yLu22itZj9qPyTpbJm\">http://doi.org/10.1111/2041-210X.12577</a></font><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\">lp,</font></div><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\">Roman</font></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
